From: Pedro <108982065+ultrapepo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 01 Oct 2026 09:10:24 GMT
Subject: [PATCH] fix(intext): resolve PSP blocker maturity per targeting key

Resolve blocking targeting maturity independently per key and source.
Keep the existing polling budget, early exclusions and request boundary.

diff --git a/src/pro/IntextManager.js b/src/pro/IntextManager.js
